ing Photos" aria-disabled="false" data-search-bot="NotBot" data-search-link="KeywordLink" data-trk-action="click:search_by_keyword; keydown-activate:search_by_keyword" data-trk-action-context="searchPhrase: Melting" itemType="http://schema.org/relatedLink">Melting Photos</a></li><li><a href="/search/2/image?phrase=No+People" class="kYN4ydKoZFw0CSKC KkF0ILjxubA5Hbhe mw2nKTIT0A098mw1" aria-label="No People Photos" aria-disabled="false" data-search-bot="NotBot" data-search-link="KeywordLink" data-trk-action="click:search_by_keyword; keydown-activate:search_by_keyword" data-trk-action-context="searchPhrase: No People" itemType="http://schema.org/relatedLink">No People Photos</a></li><li><a href="/search/2/image?phrase=Photography" class="kYN4ydKoZFw0CSKC KkF0ILjxubA5Hbhe mw2nKTIT0A098mw1" aria-label="Photography Photos" aria-disabled="false" data-search-bot="NotBot" data-search-link="KeywordLink" data-trk-action="click:search_by_keyword; keydown-activate:search_by_keyword" data-trk-action-context="searchPhrase: Photography" itemType="http://schema.org/relatedLink">Photography Photos</a></li><li><a href="/search/2/image?phrase=Sponge+Cake" class="kYN4ydKoZFw0CSKC KkF0ILjxubA5Hbhe mw2nKTIT0A098mw1" aria-label="Sponge Cake Photos" aria-disabled="false" data-search-bot="NotBot" data-search-link="KeywordLink" data-trk-action="click:search_by_keyword; keydown-activate:search_by_keyword" data-trk-action-context="searchPhrase: Sponge Cake" itemType="http://schema.org/relatedLink">Sponge Cake Photos</a></li><li><button data-testid="keyword-list-show-all" aria-disabled="false" class="id0grYWJYGMF47o6 Gca3ZuSWLHInX5_v FglMJEiGNMI_lIZW" type="button">See all</button></li></ul></div></section></div><div class="dudX_q3RB04wn7wL"><section class="mr8bs3OxqWY1Sl_u" data-testid="category-list"><h2 class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 IPHknUfm23MmLnrI emZIBXymEFBZt94O">Categories</h2><ul class="U6NNqDwiX4Ic1GSg"><li><a href="/stock-photos/pancake-day" class="kYN4ydKoZFw0CSKC KkF0ILjxubA5Hbhe" aria-label="Pancake Day" aria-disabled="false" data-trk-action="click:search_by_category; keydown-activate:search_by_category" data-trk-action-context="categoryText: Pancake Day" itemType="http://schema.org/relatedLink">Pancake Day</a></li><li><a href="/stock-photos/naan" class="kYN4ydKoZFw0CSKC KkF0ILjxubA5Hbhe" aria-label="Naan" aria-disabled="false" data-trk-action="click:search_by_category; keydown-activate:search_by_category" data-trk-action-context="categoryText: Naan" itemType="http://schema.org/relatedLink">Naan</a></li><li><a href="/stock-photos/food-and-drink" class="kYN4ydKoZFw0CSKC KkF0ILjxubA5Hbhe" aria-label="Food and drink" aria-disabled="false" data-trk-action="click:search_by_category; keydown-activate:search_by_category" data-trk-action-context="categoryText: Food and drink" itemType="http://schema.org/relatedLink">Food and drink</a></li></ul></section></div><section class="MN0NbJ6ZBYkjxlVX IpO2vyKoGz0Khfig ekn9cPb9yokoG_AA yAb1GueuuMc2esEA Lv19xM1xVFQhyWtG"><div class="MN0NbJ6ZBYkjxlVX N2pURkbip2QG3QYE ekn9cPb9yokoG_AA oVlM2SkqmMDazjc7"><div data-testid="faq-section" class="MN0NbJ6ZBYkjxlVX c0ldnGbE3eQ_eRQf Lv19xM1xVFQhyWtG"><div><h2 class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 UJvKjxFWbt0yb4yu vEVesH3Tyzgpwl7Y">Frequently asked questions</h2><hr class="w49v_3IwxaI_y6gr"/><dl><dt class="my4h6tbr_aUb54DP"><span class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 Mudg4O0gA1Mj9Nax">What&#x27;s a royalty-free license?</span></dt><dd class="OVsPv7uTUMQJcPDt"><div class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 mPD3V6jfBZcRjSCf mA1aiDDwHkMyG9JQ"><span data-testid="sanitizedString">Royalty-free licenses let you pay once to use copyrighted images and video clips in personal and commercial projects on an ongoing basis without requiring additional payments each time you use that content. It's a win-win, and it's why everything on iStock is only available royalty-free — including all <a href="/photos/baked">Baked</a> images and footage.</span></div></dd><dt class="my4h6tbr_aUb54DP"><span class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 Mudg4O0gA1Mj9Nax">What kinds of royalty-free files are available on iStock?</span></dt><dd class="OVsPv7uTUMQJcPDt"><div class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 mPD3V6jfBZcRjSCf mA1aiDDwHkMyG9JQ"><span data-testid="sanitizedString">Royalty-free licenses are the best option for anyone who needs to use stock images commercially, which is why every file on iStock — whether it’s a <a href="/stock-photos">photo</a>, <a href="/stock-illustrations">illustration</a> or <a href="/footage">video clip</a> — is only available royalty-free.</span></div></dd><dt class="my4h6tbr_aUb54DP"><span class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 Mudg4O0gA1Mj9Nax">How can you use royalty-free images and video clips?</span></dt><dd class="OVsPv7uTUMQJcPDt"><div class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 mPD3V6jfBZcRjSCf mA1aiDDwHkMyG9JQ"><span data-testid="sanitizedString">From social media ads to billboards, PowerPoint presentations to feature films, you're free to modify, resize and customize every asset on iStock — including all <a href="/photos/baked">Baked</a> images and footage — to fit your projects. With the exception of "Editorial use only" photos (which can only be used in editorial projects and can't be modified), the possibilities are limitless.</span></div></dd></dl><hr class="nRZYtF6JtIEuPoEc"/></div></div><p data-testid="learn-more-section" class="JGT3mx9GBospOrc5 IPHknUfm23MmLnrI qY3RMWoAc7MC0z2F"><span data-testid="sanitizedString">Learn more about <a href="/royalty-free-images">royalty-free images</a> or view <a href="/faq/using-files#photos">FAQs related to stock photos</a>.</span></p></div></section></div></div></div><!--/$--><!--/$--></div>
